    {
      "source": "Create a new <a href=\"RedisCache.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCache</code></a> with the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>name</code></a> and <a href=\"RedisCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheConfiguration</code></a>, using the\n<a href=\"RedisCacheWriter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheWriter</code></a> to execute Redis commands supporting the cache operations.",
      "translation": "使用给定的 <a href=\"RedisCache.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>name</code></a> 和 <a href=\"RedisCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheConfiguration</code></a> 创建一个新的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>RedisCache</code></a>，并通过 <a href=\"RedisCacheWriter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheWriter</code></a> 执行支持缓存操作的 Redis 命令。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
