    {
      "source": "Use <a href=\"RedisCacheManager.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheManager</code></a> to create <a href=\"RedisCache.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCache</code></a> instances.",
