    {
      "source": "Actual clearing may be performed in an asynchronous or deferred fashion, with subsequent lookups possibly still\nseeing the entries. This may for example be the case with transactional cache decorators. Use <a href=\"#invalidate()\"><code>invalidate()</code></a>\nfor guaranteed immediate removal of entries.",
      "translation": "实际的清除可能是异步或延迟执行的，随后的查找仍可能看到这些条目。例如，事务性缓存装饰器就可能存在这种情况。请使用<a href=\"#invalidate()\"><code>invalidate()</code></a>来确保立即移除条目。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Statistics are accumulated per cache instance and not from the backing Redis data store.",
      "translation": "统计信息是按缓存实例累积的，而非来自后端 Redis 数据存储。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Clear keys that match the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>keyPattern</code></a>.",
      "translation": "清除与给定<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>keyPattern</code></a>匹配的键。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalArgumentException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">IllegalArgumentException</a></code> - if either the given <a href=\"RedisCacheWriter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheWriter</code></a> or <a href=\"RedisCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheConfiguration</code></a>\n          are null or the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> name for this <a href=\"RedisCache.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCache</code></a> is null.",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalArgumentException.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\">IllegalArgumentException</a></code> - 如果给定的 <a href=\"RedisCacheWriter.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.cache 中的接口\"><code>RedisCacheWriter</code></a> 或 <a href=\"RedisCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.cache 中的类\"><code>RedisCacheConfiguration</code></a> 为 null，或者给定此 <a href=\"RedisCache.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.cache 中的类\"><code>RedisCache</code></a> 的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>String</code></a> 名称为 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>valueLoader</code> - <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/Callable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>Callable</code></a> object used to load the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>value</code></a> for the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>key</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<code>valueLoader</code> - 用于加载给定 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>key</code></a> 对应的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>value</code></a> 的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/Callable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>Callable</code></a> 对象。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "the configured <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/ConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>ConversionService</code></a> used to convert <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>cache keys</code></a> to a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> when\n        accessing entries in the cache.",
      "translation": "配置的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/ConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>ConversionService</code></a> 用于在访问缓存条目时将 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>cache keys</code></a> 转换为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<span id=\"loadCacheValue(java.lang.Object,java.util.concurrent.Callable)-type-param-T\"><code>T</code> - <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>type</code></a> of the loaded <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>cache value</code></a>.</span>",
      "translation": "<span id=\"loadCacheValue(java.lang.Object,java.util.concurrent.Callable)-type-param-T\"><code>T</code> - 已加载的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>缓存值</code></a> 的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>类型</code></a>。</span>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>name</code> - <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>name</code></a> for this <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/cache/Cache.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.cache\"><code>Cache</code></a>; must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>name</code> - 此 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/cache/Cache.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.cache\"><code>Cache</code></a> 的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>name</code></a>；不能为 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>cacheWriter</code> - <a href=\"RedisCacheWriter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheWriter</code></a> used to perform <a href=\"RedisCache.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCache</code></a> operations by executing the\n         necessary Redis commands; must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>cacheWriter</code> - 用于通过执行必要的 Redis 命令来执行 <a href=\"RedisCache.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCache</code></a> 操作的 <a href=\"RedisCacheWriter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheWriter</code></a>；不能为 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>cacheConfiguration</code> - <a href=\"RedisCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheConfiguration</code></a> applied to this <a href=\"RedisCache.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCache</code></a> on creation; must not\n         be null.",
      "translation": "<code>cacheConfiguration</code> - 在创建此 <a href=\"RedisCache.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCache</code></a> 时应用的 <a href=\"RedisCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheConfiguration</code></a>；不能为 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>key</code> - <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>key</code></a> mapped to the loaded <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>cache value</code></a>.",
