      "source": "an immutable <a href=\"RedisCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheConfiguration</code></a> used to configure this <a href=\"RedisCache.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCache</code></a> on initialization.",
